  "licenseNotes": "Draft \u2014 unreleased pending human visual, technical, and rights review. Procedural geometry, spectral PBR textures, Elastica skeletal rig, and reference controller authored originally with zero third-party meshes, fonts, or images. Generator, controller, and validation scripts retain the repository MIT license.",
