  "sourcing": {
    "decision": "create",
    "checkedDate": "2026-11-26",
    "localSearch": "Searched FrilAssets (assets/, materials/paper/, textures/, images/) and sibling FrilStudio/FrilCraft/FrilRemotion/FrilAdd repositories read-only. No existing editorial magazine model or coated paper PBR package exists.",
    "externalEvaluation": "Evaluated Poly Haven (decorative_book_set_01, CC0), ambientCG (Paper001, Paper005, Paper006, CC0), and Sketchfab downloadable CC0 models per docs/asset-sourcing.md. Existing CC0 book models are static closed props with baked covers, and ambientCG paper maps represent uncoated office or kraft packaging paper rather than 135 gsm silk-matte interior stock, 280 gsm satin cover stock, and 0.15 mm layered trimmed paper-block edges. Authored deterministic procedural geometry, coherent spectral PBR maps, bind-space Thickness_Scale morph targets, and length-preserving Elastica skeletal animation in generate.py."
  },
