      "script": "generate.py",
      "thirdPartyContent": false,
      "notes": "Deterministically synthesizes 7 coherent periodic spectral-heightfield PBR paper and layered-edge PNG maps into textures/, constructs the A4 (210 x 297 mm) perfect-bound magazine assembly with bind-space Thickness_Scale morph targets and 233-bone Elastica skeletal rig, bakes 6 complete lifecycle slotted actions (Magazine_Open, Magazine_PageTurn, Magazine_PageTurn_Back, Magazine_Close, Magazine_Close_Back, Magazine_Open_Back), exports and post-compacts self-contained model.glb (isolating Magazine_PageTurn and Magazine_PageTurn_Back strictly to 33 channels), renders preview.webp, and saves relative-path model.blend."
    },
    {
      "type": "reference-runtime-controller",
      "tool": "Three.js ES Module (three@0.186.1 GLTFLoader / SkeletonUtils / WebGLRenderer)",
      "script": "magazine_controller.mjs",
      "thirdPartyContent": false,
      "notes": "Reusable asset-level reference controller providing configurable even interior page counts (verified across 4, 10, 24, 50, 100, and 200 pages), dynamic stack thickness via Thickness_Scale morph targets, front/back cover open/close, forward/backward turns, normalized [0, 1] progress, pause/resume/reverse/cancel/commit, per-instance material isolation, and bounded 16-page LRU GPU texture caching."
    }
  ],
